    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Rathfarnham are proud to present 2A Marley Lawn to the market. This wonderful newly constructed four-bedroom detached home comes to the market in show-house condition having just been completed following an extensive design and construction process. A total rarity, it is one of the only newly built homes to come to the market in this mature development since it was first completed back in the 1970's. With a style in keeping with neighbouring homes 2A blends beautifully with its surroundings yet features modern construction benefits and boasts top quality finishes throughout and the highest possible BER Energy Rating A0.\n\nSet on a generous corner site 2A Marley Lawn is perfectly positioned at the heart of Marley Grange. Located right opposite Marlay Park, Marley Grange features quiet cul-de-sacs, green spaces and excellent pedestrian access to Grange Road, Stonemasons Way, and Grange Manor Road with direct vehicular access via Grange Road. The local area boasts excellent amenities including a range of shopping centres nearby at Grange Road Shopping Centre, Ballinteer Shopping Centre and of course Dundrum Town Centre. There are schools at all levels within walking distance and a huge range of sports clubs, many positioned right across the road at Marlay Park which itself offers a huge range or leisure activities. Local public transport is also excellent with regular bus services passing on Grange Road and Stonemasons Way and the M50 on-ramp at Dundrum is only a two-minute drive away. \n\nOffering approximately 131 square metres of living space set over two floors 2A Marley Grange has been thoughtfully designed with modern living in mind. Entering via the attractive composite front door one finds oneself in a large L-shaped entrance hall with spacious guest w.c. and large laundry room off. To the left is a beautiful bright living room with exceptionally large sliding glass doors opening to the side garden and parking area. To the right is a lovely dual aspect kitchen/dining room complete with bespoke fitted kitchen and boasting a full range of integrated appliances. Double doors open from the kitchen to the private walled south-facing garden with newly seeded lawn and landscaped hedging. Positioned off the kitchen is a practical Pantry with extensive built-in storage. Upstairs lie four spacious bedrooms including a wonderful dual aspect master suite with its own en-suite bathroom as well as a generous family bathroom. The three largest bedrooms feature high quality built-in wardrobes. \n\nWith high quality finishes throughout 2A Marley Lawn sits ready for its new owners to move straight in. The brand-new house features all new tile, laminate wood, and carpet flooring as well as bespoke cabinetry, quality bathroom and kitchen fittings and a top-quality finish throughout. \n\nAvailable immediately with no onward chain 2A Marley Lawn must be seen to be fully appreciated and viewings can be arranged with selling agent Dan Steen."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 6.0m x 1.35m\nBright and welcoming L-shaped entrance hall with laminate wood flooring and under-stair storage.\n\nLiving Room - 5.8m x 5.45m\nLight filled reception room with laminate wood flooring and most impressive sliding doors to side garden & parking area.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 5.0m x 4.5m\nLovely dual aspect kitchen/dining room with laminate wood flooring. Beautiful bespoke fitted kitchen with quartz countertops, satin brass hardware and a full range of integrated appliances including Neff electric oven & ceramic hob, Beko fridge-freezer, Indesit dishwasher and canopy extractor. Generous seating area by bay window, practical pantry and double doors opening to south-facing private garden.\n\nPantry - 2.0m x 1.25m\nPractical pantry space positioned off the kitchen dining area with tile flooring and bespoke storage cabinets along with heating system hardware & controls.\n\nLaundry Room - 2.1m x 1.5m\nConvenient laundry room with tile flooring, worktop and new Indesit washing machine and separate dryer.\n\nGuest W.C. - 2.0m x 1.15m\nDownstairs guest w.c. with tile flooring, chrome heated towel rail and wash basin.\n\nLanding - 5.0m x 2m\nSpacious first floor landing space with new carpet flooring and attic access above.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.7m x 3.5m\nMost impressive dual aspect master bedroom with laminate wood flooring, built-in wardrobes, en-suite bathroom, and pleasant outlook over side garden & Marley Avenue below.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.7m x 1.4m\nBeautiful en-suite bathroom with tile flooring, wash basin, w.c., chrome heated towel rail and extra-large shower.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.7m x 3.6m\nGenerous double bedroom with laminate wood flooring, built-in wardrobes, and pleasant outlook over side garden & parking area below.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.9m x 2.4m\nRear bedroom with laminate wood flooring and built-in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.8m x 2.5m\nRear bedroom with laminate wood flooring.\n\nBathroom - \nFamily bathroom with tile flooring, wash basin, w.c., chrome heated towel rail and full-size bath with rainfall shower above.\n\nPrivate Walled Garden - 9.5m x 8.2m\nPrivate south-facing walled side garden with patio, newly seeded lawn, landscaped hedging, mature tree, outdoor tap, and power points. Double doors lead directly to kitchen/dining area.\n\nSide Garden & Parking Area - 9.0m x 7.5m\nPrivate driveway with cobble lock parking area offering off-street parking for two cars. Raised planters and direct access to living area via sliding door.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Most impressive newly built four-bedroom detached house</li><li> Excellent position at the heart of a mature family-friendly development</li><li> Finished to a very high standard throughout including high quality fittings & finishes</li><li> Spacious 131 square metres of living accommodation spread across two floors</li><li> Energy efficient A0 rated home with top quality insulation, windows, and Hisense heat pump heating system</li><li> Private walled south-facing garden space</li><li> Generous driveway & side garden with parking for 2 cars</li><li> Excellent location close to a wealth of amenities</li><li> Beautiful contemporary decor throughout</li><li> Finished to showhouse standards ready to move in</li><li> Bespoke kitchen with integrated appliances</li><li> Separate pantry and laundry rooms with new appliances</li><li> Three modern bathrooms with quality fixtures in all</li><li> Rare opportunity to acquire a new build home in a mature highly sought after development</ul>"
